{"recommendationid": "44625038", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150553437", "personaname": "Yeheyin夜和音", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Yeheyin/", "num_games_owned": 846, "num_reviews": 159, "playtime_forever": 1440, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 730, "last_played": 1687290131, "avatar": "7dc63257925a5f9316efb2abbb02a9bb67712023"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好游戏，服务器能更好就不错了...会掉线\n有好友玩才是最重要的。", "timestamp_created": 1536377185, "timestamp_updated": 1536479416, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "44615737", "author": {"steamid": "76561198842646976", "personaname": "S0ron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198842646976/", "num_games_owned": 146, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 531, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 128, "last_played": 1604061552, "avatar": "a1f6fe24c440b766dd074bd8a8ecc69c5b759e7c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏不错，非常有想法。只是现阶段内容不多，发展空间还有很大，非常期待其日后表现。\n\n————————————————————分割线——————————————————\n2019.7.12附加：\n   将近一年后，我又打开这个游戏顺带完成了几个成就，而完成这些成就时，我发现这几个成就是最容易完成的成就，我看了一下成就的全球统计，却发现第一个完成的成就（完成第一个任务）这样简单的成就达成条件，完成的人也只有百分之20多，而那些难以完成的成就则连百分之1还不到。这我不知道是因为成就系统刚出还是咋样，但很明显的显显出游戏的问题：要么是老玩家留存太少，要么是游戏有些地方设计不太合众。\n   虽然我对游戏了解的时间只有仅仅6小时不到，但目前为止，我并没有发现什么问题，但如果让我说出这游戏的出众的地方，却又不好开口了。重点是，这个游戏多人玩应该会更好，但我并没有能一起玩的人，所以可能是因为这样，让我这个自闭玩家不好体验这款作品的出众的地方吧。\n  P.S.我因个人原因无法让游戏游玩时长在更有参考价值时发布评测，所以如此评测有写的不全面、不合理的地方，请见谅。", "timestamp_created": 1536331415, "timestamp_updated": 1562913559, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44609109", "author": {"steamid": "76561198107023011", "personaname": "呜呜卡", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198107023011/", "num_games_owned": 109, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1551, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 442, "last_played": 1541603391, "avatar": "360236e555049f204b12d3a8685a3b9b9764ebfe"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不错的游戏，只是目前还比较单调，希望官方能够 增加游戏的多样性", "timestamp_created": 1536293255, "timestamp_updated": 1536293255, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541984736919403076", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}